      "writtenOn": "2019-08-13T11:04:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that\u0027s the plan. Each module implementing SdkAware interface (like cc_library, java_library) have their own uses_sdks property. The plan is that build will break when those properties from individual modules do not comply with the uses_sdks property of the containing Module (e.g. apex).\n\nHowever, for now, since I don\u0027t want to touch every modules to add set this property correct, I\u0027ve made them to be inheritable. (there are literally too many modules to be touched if we do this for native libs.)",
